      "Common LED TV screen symptoms",
      "Common symptoms include black screen, sound but no picture, visible cracks, vertical lines, horizontal lines, half display, dim picture, flicker, white screen and color patches. Each symptom can have different causes, so GR Solution checks power, backlight, T-Con, motherboard, panel and input behavior.",
      "Delhi NCR service guidance",
      "For Delhi, share locality details such as New Kondli, Mayur Vihar, Laxmi Nagar, Preet Vihar or Dwarka. For Noida, mention your sector and society access. For Greater Noida, share nearby landmarks such as Pari Chowk, Knowledge Park or Greater Noida West. For Ghaziabad, share whether you are in Indirapuram, Vaishali, Vasundhara, Kaushambi, Raj Nagar Extension, Crossings Republik or Sahibabad. Location, access and wall-mount status help with safe visit planning.",
      "Backlight versus screen repair",
      "If sound works but the picture is dark, the fault may be backlight-related rather than a full screen replacement. If the panel glass is cracked or pressure damaged, repair feasibility changes. Diagnosis prevents the customer from choosing the wrong repair path.",
      "Repair versus replacement",
      "Repair may be practical when the issue is backlight, board, sound, input or T-Con related. Replacement may be sensible when the panel is cracked, water damaged, heavily lined or when parts are unavailable or too costly.",
      "What to check before calling",
      "Check whether sound works, whether a torchlight shows faint picture, whether menus appear, whether cracks are visible and whether the issue appears on all inputs. Share model number, screen size, location and a photo or video with GR Solution.",
